{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_title", "source_sha256": "d4fe1a885dce0246610dc23bb613acc7da81a32750df0bbe8b3e0ece4a2da545", "ja": "アピールはKAWAII♪", "zh": "表现是KAWAII♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_synopsis", "source_sha256": "db701b7bfc74fbc656a896b808e8619dabf2c4b34c59fbc2f4638a2a41cfcb69", "ja": "合同イベントの宣伝でテレビに出演する\n未来、真、響。共演者のインフルエンサーに\n挨拶をしに行くが鼻で笑われてしまう。\nしかし、本番でのアピールで自分たちの\nカワイイを見せつけ、認めさせるのだった。", "zh": "未来、真、响为了宣传联合活动\n出演电视节目。她们前去向同台的\n网红打招呼，却遭到了嗤之以鼻的嘲笑。\n然而，她们在正式演出中展现魅力，\n大秀属于自己的可爱，令对方刮目相看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1000_null", "source_sha256": "1316f38eb72312e8aa6fd003e3c52f94b4601c1c7fdcbc5093ce7325177c647a", "ja": "―合同イベント　プロモーション番組出演―", "zh": "—联合活动　宣传节目出演—", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "9fb33b6b8882aedc5d6cdfff327f8c7d13d4e176d0d422980bcfe69a6c8aec1d", "ja": "わぁ～……！　響さん、真さん、すごいです！\nテレビで観たことある人がいっぱい！", "zh": "哇～……！响小姐、真小姐，好厉害！\n好多都是我在电视上见过的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "a734f4fab0fd069db0b14903dde4002e91f197a9ddf0a1f1afcc34d521860189", "ja": "あっははは、ここテレビ局だからねっ。\n自分たちも今からテレビに出るんだぞ！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈，因为这里可是电视台嘛。\n我们接下来也要上电视了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "21cc8b8c07baa3263e181333906431d4e5e69c893e9785b53802f4828cd3a282", "ja": "合同イベントのプロモーションでね。\n3つのKAWAIIパワーを1つに集めて、頑張ろう！", "zh": "为了联合活动的宣传呢。\n把3种KAWAII力量汇聚为1，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "b8aaf56129dbdbefa45aac0a49410653ad6e89b38b2e26a5c3f00972339cad65", "ja": "はい！　私たちのかわいさ、\nいっぱいアピールしちゃいましょう！", "zh": "好！我们一定要好好展现自己的可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "e09a1c1fe386a77fd5ce3bf144bf0375476a59be6257c09e78f226e217a3503f", "ja": "あ、でも最初に、同じ楽屋の人に挨拶しなきゃ。\n{$P$}さんに言われましたもんね？", "zh": "啊，不过首先得去跟同一个休息室的人打招呼才行。\n{$P$}先生都这么说了嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "cb6ac0689c81bf04a5e68d597f24a43d3c19e49ea0f310c79106ab0f5b8a9bef", "ja": "おっと、そうだよね。声かけてみようか。\n……あのー、すみません！", "zh": "哦，对了。确实该去打个招呼。要不要试着叫一下呢？\n……那个——不好意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1007_miyurityan", "source_sha256": "a8031da68ad4622602beb9e74e6f1c670de0e59d5a854e7d773f477dc242e1bd", "ja": "……え、わたしですか？", "zh": "……诶，是我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "f44e1dbceec16119e56f496cafc9994805c1749ad7d50a13213dc33b5c88858e", "ja": "あっ！　配信ライブがすごいバズってる、\nカワイイインフルエンサーのみゆりちゃん！", "zh": "啊！就是那个直播演出超级火、可爱的网红みゆり！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "e9af400b951ac7e1763fd108cfcace9fd1989d75eeda4a3907c4fc7f795269b0", "ja": "ボクたち765プロのアイドルで、\n我那覇響、春日未来、菊地真です。", "zh": "我们是765职业偶像，我那霸响、春日未来和菊地真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "f5ab1d23d8da2034b649cebf6cd2e7817534065c2ac01c97efc129969397fa7c", "ja": "今日はよろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "今天请多多关照啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "5af16a76851013dbb3293183720718dd39460b3236b7f3277ddc7af8a8832b4e", "ja": "ホンモノのみゆりちゃん、細くてかわいい～♪\n私たちも今度、すーっごくカワイイ曲歌うんですよ！", "zh": "真正的美由里，身材纤细又可爱～♪\n我们下次也要唱一首超——可爱的歌哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1012_miyurityan", "source_sha256": "c6e95a787f01d9a6059c4beb8f3edd69ee4f9896851618f88722d381b9b76b49", "ja": "カワイイ曲……あなたたちが？", "zh": "可爱风格的歌曲……你们？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1013_miyurityan", "source_sha256": "55cf0a509d0d5ca0fb2d239b3ef36482a30683b8d183b127637cdc1ee54de54e", "ja": "そんな騒がしいキャラで、その衣装で？　……ププッ！\nまあ元気は良さそうですね。頑張って♡", "zh": "你这种吵吵闹闹的角色，还穿成这样？……噗噗！\n\n不过看起来倒是很有精神。加油哦♡", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "607be12afd8f2e01706bd3f96e41f007bfd002afdbab481bf4775a608dee23e7", "ja": "……へ？", "zh": "……诶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "b388a6dc741c8d5a8d577bbeec7d993ea36935eee0903f80b5000a507583ea46", "ja": "うぎぎ……！　なんか、やな感じ！", "zh": "呜呜呜……！感觉真讨厌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "142da86a858971bdc1c2250086c81b218818e7b557bf97a9635218dfe16d9218", "ja": "たしかに自分たち、あの子みたいに大人しそうじゃ\nないけど……でもすっごくカワイイよね！？", "zh": "确实，我们不像那孩子一样看起来那么乖巧，\n不过……真的超级可爱吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "eef8659aba572f8d0d2f28eb6323f5e0139ddd5c466d5a2f0c61e372983b64c3", "ja": "ボクは気にしてないよ。カワイイは心だと思う。\n見た目や振舞いだけの問題じゃない……。ないよね！？", "zh": "我不介意哦。我觉得可爱是发自内心的。\n不只是外表和举止的问题……对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "0e308413eef0b48f0bb17932e94b54bc38ddda1acb4f569819ec6fcf536d8c7c", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、真さん、響さん！\n私たちだって絶対カワイイです！", "zh": "没事的，真小姐、响小姐！\n我们也绝对很可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "68e8cac6ae59d02a4b7ea3ff195fcabe84285c67f197c48898b2baefb86f61f8", "ja": "私たちのカワイさで、\nみゆりちゃんをあっと言わせちゃいましょう♪", "zh": "就用我们的可爱，\n让美由里大吃一惊吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1020_null", "source_sha256": "24b03aa3e87be88fd0b4fe1ed5d931b67e769ab7a12eec3241016fb322612b3e", "ja": "そして、本番……", "zh": "然后，正式演出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "f70401a3e686c1c028491ca2248b12e840a85a40303ec5f6fcd5945629930387", "ja": "みんなー！\n自分たちのステージ、かわいかったでしょ！？", "zh": "大家——！\n我们的舞台很可爱吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1022_audience", "source_sha256": "50b7736f523a1dd79a6400e32537acd263040ecea6d774adbd67f1c53ade4937", "ja": "ワアアアァァァ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1023_kannkyakua", "source_sha256": "54d76c29bc27dc8b1ecd923cf3ece3a31f895739b1c82d90d6e3173af89315b2", "ja": "カワイイ……元気カワイイって言うか、\nどストレートに聞いてくるあたりも素直カワイイ！", "zh": "好可爱……该说是元气可爱吧，\n直截了当地问出来的样子也坦率得可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "94437d4d71a980313df42d17aae29479df22e5ffd5afc8dc2a77904daad1cea2", "ja": "さらにカワイイの必殺奥義！　行っくぞ～！\n全身全霊の……まっこまっこり～ん♪", "zh": "而且还有可爱的必杀奥义！要上啦～！\n全身心的……真真琳～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1025_audience", "source_sha256": "50b7736f523a1dd79a6400e32537acd263040ecea6d774adbd67f1c53ade4937", "ja": "ワアアアァァァ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1026_kannkyakub", "source_sha256": "6f7ab76206b703b828056ad3bcf7a50ba35d4c3be7037cf7aa4ee407e660709f", "ja": "何て力強い……！　どこか無理があるあたりが\nカワイイ！　潔くて、イタカワイイ！", "zh": "好有力量……！那种不知哪里有点勉强的地方，真可爱！干脆利落，尴尬得可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "bde9696142b18074d3e131029f1afe134e9cd08665ea15b2f0006ca94c2ae214", "ja": "ここで私がダメ押し！　春日未来、あんまり特技とか\nないからエアギター弾きます！　ベンベンべベーン♪", "zh": "接下来由我来补上最后一击！春日未来，因为我也没什么拿手特技，就来弹空气吉他！蹦蹦哒哒——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1028_audience", "source_sha256": "50b7736f523a1dd79a6400e32537acd263040ecea6d774adbd67f1c53ade4937", "ja": "ワアアアァァァ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1029_kannkyakuc", "source_sha256": "2b22e839ec3f00626681482070914e3b068ef479893d78d0295d58d21939713a", "ja": "カワイイ……！　なんの脈絡もないことを堂々と！\nなんて無邪気カワイイ！　3人とも文句なしだ！", "zh": "好可爱……！居然堂堂正正地说出毫无关联的话！\n真是天真又可爱！不管是3个人都无可挑剔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1030_audience", "source_sha256": "4db64f55031345153b90c687fa5167bf68eb3bfda6f6eb2ea7df4aea49ba70f7", "ja": "カワイイ！　カワイイ！　カワイイ！　カワイイ！", "zh": "好可爱！　好可爱！　好可爱！　好可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1031_miyurityan", "source_sha256": "aed46e269f387f748f9db6e9e30b11de82d44501fae7b0f3cc31ee97a0737454", "ja": "フン……なかなかやるじゃない。\nあなたたちの『カワイイ』、認めてあげる。", "zh": "哼……还挺有两下子的嘛。  \n我就承认你们的“可爱”吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1032_audience", "source_sha256": "cebc9a32dc25c092ef0a7a69dd7c9bb492b18a4136f4b2081d9cb64ef2d016d8", "ja": "カワイイ！　カワイイ！　腹黒カワイイ！", "zh": "可爱！可爱！腹黑可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1033_013hib", "source_sha256": "cd5ca61b8cae9bea9f9ef36d1369f376c3d8d84fc1d8205fed62953e78125f01", "ja": "認めてもらえたのはいいけど……\nなんか、何を言っても大盛り上がりだぞ？", "zh": "被认可固然是好事……\n不过，感觉说什么都能引起一片欢呼呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1034_006mak", "source_sha256": "3f1901bd81a9c08e690b1fd4017a7188ed8de9df7034b2147b3db2ce6caa4f1b", "ja": "もしかして、今日のお客さんには\nなんでもカワイイんじゃ……？", "zh": "难道说，今天的客人觉得什么都可爱……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0416_story_014mir_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0416_story_014mir_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "755dd41f6a7a324de112ed20fc1c1621a409319b3038f5d2de23867d290c3df7", "ja": "きっとアイドルはみんなカワイイってことですよっ。\n合同イベントも、絶対成功間違いなし！　ですね♪", "zh": "偶像肯定都很可爱吧。\n联合活动也绝对会成功，没错♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
